1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
REPO Command Console: one searchable F2 console.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Screenshot walkthrough: 2.0.0 captures,
plus 2.1.0 command text examples.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
In a lobby or run, press F2 to open the console.
F2 toggles it; Escape closes it.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,500
Type part of a target name.
Use Up or Down to select a suggestion.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Press Tab to accept the exact target
from your live game catalog.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Press Enter to spawn, then read the result.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
This genuine capture shows a successful spawn
of three Strength Upgrades.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Despawn matching objects created by this mod.
Normal level content is left alone.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,000
New in 2.1.0; text examples, not live footage.
/revive all needs available death heads.

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
/heal all fully heals living targets.
Select one player, or use all.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
/chain all revive heal truck
runs the actions in that order.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Each group-wide step finishes before the next.
A failed step stops the chain.

13
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Find RepoCommandConsole for R.E.P.O.
Install with Mod Manager, then Start Modded.

14
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
The host and command users need the mod.
The host controls multiplayer permissions.
